# Glen Elendra's Answer: "Counter all spells your opponents control and all abilities your opponents control. Create a
# 1/1 blue and black Faerie creature token with flying for each spell and ability countered this way." On turn 2 Bot2
# casts Baleful Strix (its enters trigger goes on the stack), then Lightning Bolt at Bot1 and Mishra's Bauble's ability: a
# triggered ability, a spell and an activated ability. Bot1 answers with its own Bauble ability (an ability Bot1 controls)
# and then the Answer: the three of Bot2's are countered - Bot1 keeps 20 life, Bot2 draws no card from the Strix - and
# three Faeries come, while Bot1's own Bauble ability stays and resolves.

